            "text": "Hun sa at hun bor i Trondheim.",
            "why": "Correct. The present tense fits because it is still true."
          },
          {
            "option_id": "b",
            "text": "Hun sa at bor hun i Trondheim.",
            "why": "The reported clause needs subject before finite verb."
          },
          {
            "option_id": "c",
            "text": "Hun sa om hun bor i Trondheim.",
            "why": "Om reports yes/no questions, not statements."
          }
        ],
        "answer_id": "a",
